+# HCG Jailbreak Academy
+
+Static, self-contained educational guide "Why & How to Jailbreak Your iPhone" (example jailbreak: Dopamine),
+published at `<site>/academy/jailbreak/` **only** when `config/repo.toml` has `[academy] enabled = true`.
+
+- Source of truth, sources, compatibility tests and review notes: `F1r3srp3nt/HCG-Jailbreak-Research`, folder `academy/`
+  and `docs/`. Edit the guide there and copy `academy/jailbreak/` and `academy/assets/` here.
+- The build copies `.html`, `.css`, `.js` and image files only (`site.copy_academy`); this README is not published.
+- The page links the site's own `assets/site.css`, brand files and `repo/CydiaIcon@2x.png`, so it only works inside
+  this site.
+- It installs nothing and runs nothing. It hosts no Dopamine, TrollStore, Sileo or Zebra files: every download link
+  points to the official source.
+- Before enabling: the owner's publication approval, a fresh review of the compatibility ranges and of the HCG product
+  statuses in chapter 15, and removal of `<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">` if the page should be indexed.
