+<rect x="500" y="40" width="230" height="86" rx="8" fill="#10181e" stroke="#4fcf91" stroke-width="2"/><text x="615.0" y="76" font-size="16" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Jailbroken</text><text x="615.0" y="100" font-size="12" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="middle">tweaks + package manager</text>
+<line x1="250" y1="70" x2="498" y2="70" stroke="#2fd3e6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="374.0" y="62.0" font-size="12" fill="#2fd3e6" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">open Dopamine › Jailbreak</text>
+<line x1="500" y1="110" x2="252" y2="110" stroke="#e7b866" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah)"/><text x="376.0" y="132" font-size="12" fill="#e7b866" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">full reboot / power off / battery dies</text>
+<path d="M560 128 C560 200 670 200 670 128" fill="none" stroke="#4fcf91" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#ah)"/>
+<text x="615" y="214" font-size="12" fill="#4fcf91" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">respring / userspace reboot:</text>
+<text x="615" y="230" font-size="12" fill="#4fcf91" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">stays jailbroken</text>
+<text x="30" y="270" font-size="13" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Semi-untethered: the jailbreak lives in memory and is re-applied with the app after every full reboot.</text>
