+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 760 330" width="760" height="330" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif">
+<title id="t">Rootful versus rootless</title>
+<desc id="d">Rootful jailbreaks write into the system volume. Rootless jailbreaks such as Dopamine leave the system volume alone and keep all jailbreak files under /var/jb on the data volume.</desc>
+<rect width="760" height="330" fill="#0a1116"/>
+<text x="30" y="36" font-size="17" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start">Rootful (older style)</text>
+<text x="30" y="56" font-size="12" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">package architecture iphoneos-arm</text>
+<rect x="30" y="72" width="330" height="96" rx="6" fill="#10181e" stroke="#2a3a45"/>
+<text x="44" y="98" font-size="12" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">System volume:  /  (/Applications, /usr, /Library …)</text>
+<text x="44" y="122" font-size="12" fill="#e7b866" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">✎ jailbreak files written here</text>
+<text x="44" y="142" font-size="11.5" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">tweaks install into / directly</text>
+<rect x="30" y="182" width="330" height="96" rx="6" fill="#10181e" stroke="#2a3a45"/>
+<text x="44" y="208" font-size="12" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">Data volume:  /var, /private/preboot …</text>
+<text x="44" y="232" font-size="12" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">user data only</text>
+<text x="44" y="252" font-size="11.5" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start"></text>
+<text x="400" y="36" font-size="17" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start">Rootless (Dopamine)</text>
+<text x="400" y="56" font-size="12" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">package architecture iphoneos-arm64</text>
+<rect x="400" y="72" width="330" height="96" rx="6" fill="#10181e" stroke="#2a3a45"/>
+<text x="414" y="98" font-size="12" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">System volume:  /  (/Applications, /usr, /Library …)</text>
+<text x="414" y="122" font-size="12" fill="#4fcf91" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">untouched by the jailbreak</text>
+<text x="414" y="142" font-size="11.5" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">the system stays as Apple shipped it</text>
+<rect x="400" y="182" width="330" height="96" rx="6" fill="#10181e" stroke="#2a3a45"/>
+<text x="414" y="208" font-size="12" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">Data volume:  /var, /private/preboot …</text>
+<text x="414" y="232" font-size="12" fill="#4fcf91" font-weight="600" text-anchor="start">✎ everything goes under /var/jb</text>
+<text x="414" y="252" font-size="11.5" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">a link to a hidden folder in /private/preboot</text>
+<text x="30" y="306" font-size="13" fill="#e6edf1" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Rootless tweaks must be rebuilt for /var/jb; Sileo shows only packages built for your layout.</text>
+<text x="30" y="324" font-size="11" fill="#9aa9b2" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Original HCG diagram, simplified.</text>
+</svg>
